[1m[38;5;231mWhat should actually trigger a notification?[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Due dates and reminders (Recommended)
         [38;5;246mClock-driven: task is due soon, is overdue, or you set an explicit reminder time. Works today with one user.[39m
[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m2.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m [38;5;153mSubscription rules (Recommended)[39m
         [38;5;246mYou mark tasks or conditions you care about; changes matching them notify you. Matches "tasks they care about"
[39m         [38;5;246mand survives into multi-user.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] Any change since you last looked
         [38;5;246mDiff-based: unseen edits get flagged. Mostly valuable once there's a second actor or a second device.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Status transitions only
         [38;5;246mNarrower: notify when a task moves between states (todo → blocked → done), regardless of subscriptions.[39m
  [38;5;246m5. [39m[ ] [38;5;246mType something[39m
